## Notes From Previous Auditors

- **Revision exception:** Preliminary data gets revised months later. Check bulletins 3-6 months after the target date.
- **Column headers:** Multi-header tables are deceptive. After extracting any number, trace the full column path: "Parent → Sub → Column."
- **Method ambiguity:** "Average" = arithmetic mean. "Average YoY growth rate" = sum of annual % changes ÷ years. Not CAGR. The simple reading is right.
- **Fiscal year:** Ends June 30 (pre-1976) or September 30 (post-1976). Calendar year ends December 31. Not interchangeable.
- **Bulletin timing:** Jan 31 data → March bulletin. Dec 31 data → June bulletin of next year. FY summary → October/December bulletin.

